    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12391" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dēbĭlĭtātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				laming, maiming; weakness</i> (rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praemium debilitationis consecutus, i. e. of
					mutilation of nose and ears,</span>”
